:: Chapter2.0
<<nobr>>
    <div class="titleParent">
        <p class="titleTop">Beginning of</p>
        <p class="titleBottom">Lost In Storm</p>
        <<set $aircraft to $aircraft - 10>>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Let's go!->Chapter2.1]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.1
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>The plane had seemingly leveled off, after a long and turbulent climb. However, you could barely see outside, due to the stormy weather. </p>
            <p><i>“The pilots must know what they’re doing in order to fly through here"</i>, you thought for yourself. Despite it being a relatively short flight, you’ve drank and absorbed way too much water, and needed to go to the bathroom.</p>
            <p> The light was green, and there was nobody at the door at the moment. You got up from your seat, shuffled sideways, and strolled to the toilet.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.2]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.2
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 2</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Before you could reach the door however, a sudden gust of wind had hit the airplane at a very precise angle, and had sent everyone flying. </p>
            <p>To make things worse, it wasn’t just a gust - it was a whole stream of the same air, and the plane shook violently. </p>
            <p>The vibration from the engine was at the correct frequency, that made the food trolley retainers unscrew. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.2_5]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.2_5
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 2 (EXTENSION)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>The trolley went flying. If nobody would stop it, it would crush the legs of everyone in the aisle seats.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Lunge for the trolley->Chapter2.3_lunge]]
        </div>
        <<timed 4s>>
            <<goto "Chapter2.3_late">>
        <</timed>>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.3_lunge
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 3 (Success)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $trust to $trust + 15>>
        <<set $stress to $stress + 10>>
        <<set $health to $health - 5>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>You lunged forward to reach the trolley before it had picked up any speed. </p>
            <p>The weight of the trolley overwhelmed you slightly, and dragged you several meters across the aisle. </p>
            <p>The trolley came to a halt. You were half suspended over the ground, arching for a grip of the trolley. </p>
            <br>
            <p>2 flight attendants ran towards you, one from the back and one from the front. </p>
            <br>
            <p><i>“That was really brave”</i>, one of them said. All 3 of you then worked together on a solution on how to secure the trolley for the rest of the flight.</p>
            <p>As you return to your seat, the passengers look slightly different on you. Seemingly, with hope. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.4]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.3_late
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 3 (TOO LATE)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $stress to $stress - 5>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>There simply wasn’t enough time. You saw the cart speed up along the isle, and had 0 chance of reaching it before it had impacted someone.</p>
            <p>Sure enough, not even 2 seconds since, a loud audible cry came from the middle of the plane. </p>
            <p>You swiftly turned your head, and saw the cart tipped over, obstructing the aisle and injuring 2 aisle seating passengers. </p>
            <p>Not even a second later, boh flight attendants scrambled to help, leaving you alone in the galley, just staring at what had just happened.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.4]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.4
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 4</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>The post was now empty, and there was no one to notice the cracking sound from the overhead bins. </p>
            <p>The jolt from the turbulence had apparently exceeded the maximum G-load of the overhead bins by an amount, and their structural integrity was compromised. </p>
            <p>You were in the lavatory at the time when the part of the bin detached. The only thing that you’ve heard is the loud bang and a sudden cry of a passenger. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Help the passenger->Chapter2.5_help]]
        </div>
        <div class="button">
            [[Ignore->Chapter2.5_ignore]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.5_help
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 5 (HELP)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $health to $health - 10>>
        <<set $trust to $trust + 10>>
        <<set $hope to $hope + 10>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p>You sprinted out of the lavatory, and you saw a very scary scene. The overhead bin, loaded with bags, had partly broken off from the ceiling, and now was on the floor, clamping passenger’s arm to the seat, as they cried in agony. </p>
           <p>With the help of 4 other people, you have lifted the bin and pushed it over to the side. The remaining cabin crew  had rushed with the first aid kits to aid the person with their hand injury. </p>
           <p><i>“What a nightmare of a flight this is, wow”</i>, you mumbled to yourself, realising that you will be scarred forever after what you have just witnessed. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.6]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.5_ignore
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 5 (IGNORE)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $stress to $stress + 15>>
        <<set $trust to $trust - 15>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p>Your stomach drops as you hear the loud rumble. </p>
           <p><i>“This is the end of it”</i>, you thought at the moment, and squatted to prepare for the worst. </p>
           <p><b>Second. 2 seconds. 3 seconds. Nothing.</b> Eventually you hear a synchronous rumble from the floor of the plane. </p>
           <p>It was coming from several people that rushed in to help the woman. As you exited the bathroom, you walked down the aisle, full of shame, to reach your seat. No one peaked at you. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter2.6]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.6
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 6</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p>For a brief moment, the violent shaking subsided. The air was comparable to a knife slicing through a warm piece of butter, yet the clouds still contained every part of the airplane, leaving nothing to see from the windows. </p>
           <p>You looked at the time on your phone. The plane was supposed to be landing in 15 minutes, but it was clear that that would not happen. </p>
           <p>Your family would be tracking your flight on their phones now. If they see the severe weather warnings off the coast of Bergen, they would be terrified. </p>
           <p><i>“I am coming, ”</i> you promised them silently. <i>“I am almost there.”</i></p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <<if $trust > 70>>
            <div class="button">
                [[Continue->Chapter2.7_o70]]
            </div>
        <<else>>
            <div class="button">
                [[Continue->Chapter2.7_u70]]
            </div>
        <</if>>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.7_o70
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 7 (TRUST)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p>The senior flight attendant walked down the aisle. You didn't think much of it until she stopped dead abeam of your seat. Your heart dropped dead. </p>
           <p>She leaned down to you, and said something quietly in the voice only you could hear. </p>
           <p><i>“We have a problem. The captain is unfortunately unable to continue the flight due to turbulence knocking him unconscious. The first officer is overwhelmed with the amount of work. We desperately need your help up there”</i></p>
           <p>As she finished speaking, the door of the cockpit broke open and you saw the captain arching over his armrest. </p>
           <p><i>“Will you help us?”</i></p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Help->Chapter2.7_o70_help]]
        </div>
        <div class="button">
            [[Ignore->Chapter2.7_o70_ignore]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.7_o70_help
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 7 (TRUST) (HELP)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p><i>“Of course. Anything to make this flight a little easier”.</i></p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter3.0]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter2.7_o70_ignore
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter2 - 7 (TRUST) (IGNORE)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
           <p><i>“I would be useless up there”. “Regardless, isn’t it your job to do that anyways?”</i></p>
           <p>Her face was stunned by your arrogant response, as she walked down the aisle to reach the bottom post.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Ending4]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>
